  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kNytodv.png\" alt=\"YUNG的叢林神廟改良版\" width=\"1344\" height=\"416\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-api-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsapibadge\" alt=\"需要 YUNG API\" width=\"211\" height=\"26\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/rns3beq\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsdiscordbadge2\" alt=\"加入 Discord 上的 YUNG GANG！\" width=\"136\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungstwitterbadge3\" alt=\"在 Twitter 上關注我！\" width=\"76\" height=\"27\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmEhjcMNhSDTRJgjVfbs9Rw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsyoutubebadge\" alt=\"訂閱我的 YouTube！\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungspatreonbadge\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我！\" width=\"138\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ujP2J5g.png\" alt=\"這是什麼？\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p>\n<p><strong>《我的世界》叢林神廟全面改裝！</strong> YUNG的叢林神廟改良版從零開始徹底重新設計了叢林神廟，擁有全新的結構、陷阱、謎題與戰利品！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ladFuIF.png\" alt=\"相容性\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p>\n<p>YUNG的叢林神廟改良版內建與眾多模組的相容性！若您安裝了以下任一模組，神廟的某些部分就有機會生成特殊構件。請注意這為選用功能&nbsp;&mdash;使用本模組並不強制要求安裝這些模組。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Create</li>\n<li>Supplementaries</li>\n<li>Pick Your Poison (僅限 1.19.2)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>YUNG的叢林神廟改良版也旨在與所有世界生成模組完全相容，包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-ocean-monuments-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG的深海神殿改良版</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-nether-fortresses-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG的地獄要塞改良版</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-extras-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG的額外內容</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252fx%252fyung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2mVOWMC.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1230\" height=\"241\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a49IMQJ.png\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fyung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nQRs7ZP.png\" alt=\"使用優惠碼 YUNGNICKYOUNG 於 Bisect Hosting 可享 25% 折扣！\" width=\"1344\" height=\"400\"></a></p>",
